sprog_inbox_legend_pills_heading = Language pills
sprog_inbox_legend_status_missing = no translation yet
sprog_inbox_legend_status_draft = value entered, not yet submitted for review
sprog_inbox_legend_status_needs_review = submitted for review, awaiting reviewer decision
sprog_inbox_legend_status_revise = reviewer requested changes, needs revision
sprog_inbox_legend_status_approved = approved for live use
sprog_inbox_legend_status_stale = source has changed, translation needs updating
sprog_inbox_legend_workflow_text = Two roles: <strong>translators</strong> (»translator« permission) enter texts and <strong>submit them for review</strong>; <strong>reviewers</strong> (»reviewer« permission) <strong>approve</strong> or <strong>return</strong> them. Flow: <strong>missing</strong> → <strong>draft</strong> (value entered) → <strong>needs review</strong> (submitted) → <strong>approved</strong>. Anyone holding both permissions for a language approves directly (no intermediate step). »Return« only appears when a translator exists for the language — otherwise the reviewer corrects it themselves. If the source changes later, affected languages fall back to <strong>stale</strong>; clearing a value resets to <strong>missing</strong>.
sprog_inbox_legend_actions_heading = Actions
sprog_inbox_legend_action_submit = Submit the translation for review by the reviewers (translators only).
sprog_inbox_legend_action_approve = Approve the translation — final, live-ready (reviewers; those with both permissions directly too).
sprog_inbox_legend_action_return = Return to the translators for rework (only when a translator exists for the language).
sprog_inbox_legend_pills_text = One small pill per language: the language code as text, the status colour as background. Languages without a translation appear in neutral grey. Hover a pill to see the language name and status in a tooltip.
